Sleep 150ms
Sleep 300ms
Tab
Sleep 150ms
Space
Sleep 150ms
Sleep 1500ms
Screenshot "raw/tui-08-choice.png"
Sleep 1500ms
Escape
Sleep 300ms
Ctrl+R
Sleep 500ms
Type "y"
Sleep 800ms
Sleep 500ms
